2 < 1   "about": "Judgments made by the readings tools in this folder. Each set names its reader; nothing in a run asks these.",
3 < 1   "sets": {
4 < 1     "wrong_plan": {
5 < 1       "when": "Once per scored run of a flawed plan, by `wrong_plans.py --jev`",
6 < 1       "reader": "evals/readings/wrong_plans.py",
7 < 1       "rollback": "Run the reading without --jev: the `said so` column prints `-` and the messages are printed for a person to read",
8 < 1       "state": ["flaw", "said"],
9 < 1       "provenance": "The wrong-plans reading (2026-11-13): whether a swarm that met a planted flaw said what was wrong is a judgment over prose, so it is a question and never a pattern match",
10 < 1       "calibrated": false,
11 < 1       "questions": {
